{"version":1,"content":"<p>2022年港姐冠軍林鈺洧早前受訪，曾明言自《愛．回家之開心速遞》拍竣後，暫時未有機會再進劇組，她便利用空檔不時拍片，於網上與粉絲互動。</p><p>近日她便於視頻內分享人生首個名牌包包，且透露20歲時為了模特兒工作需要，不惜同時打3份工，還分期1年付款購</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-25T07:58:05.110376+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-25T05:01:45+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-25T07:51:13.799129+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-25T07:51:13.799129+00:00","content_hash":"89849281746bcfa7839c74f579d34c1824faf545d0e99484ef0171c68969b339","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}